  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\nAfter interchanging the given two numbers\n\nI. 4 - 8 × __**6 ÷ 3**__ + 7 \n\n= 4 - __**8 **____**× 2**__ + 7\n\n= __**4**__ - 16 __**+ 7**__\n\n= __**11 - 16**__\n\n= -5\n\nII. __**4 × 3**__ - __**6 ÷ 2**__ + 8\n\n= __**12**__ - 3 __**+ 8**__\n\n= __**20 - 3**__\n\n= 17\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****- 5 and 17\"**.",
